{"4700520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Days Of Reckoning: Last Battle", "steam_appid": 4700520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4975270], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Days Of Reckoning</strong> is a turn-based tactical strategy game that blends modern warfare with dark, mysterious forces beyond human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command elite military units deployed into hostile territory where something has gone terribly wrong. Communication is broken. Reinforcements are uncertain. And the enemy… is not what it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a fight not only for survival — but for understanding what you're really up against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep, grid-based battles where positioning, terrain, and decision-making matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan every move carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cover, elevation, and line of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unit abilities for maximum effectiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly fire is real — and deadly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Morale-Based Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers are not machines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units react to battlefield situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morale affects combat performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic, fear, and pressure can turn the tide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced units perform better — but have more to lose</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic World Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war is larger than a single battlefield.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select missions across a dynamic world map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure regions to gain resources and advantages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas and uncover hidden threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide where to strike next</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The signal is broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever attacked… isn’t done yet.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Days Of Reckoning</strong> is a turn-based tactical strategy game that blends modern warfare with dark, mysterious forces beyond human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You command elite military units deployed into hostile territory where something has gone terribly wrong. Communication is broken. Reinforcements are uncertain. And the enemy… is not what it should be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a fight not only for survival — but for understanding what you're really up against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep, grid-based battles where positioning, terrain, and decision-making matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan every move carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cover, elevation, and line of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unit abilities for maximum effectiveness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly fire is real — and deadly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Morale-Based Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soldiers are not machines.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units react to battlefield situations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morale affects combat performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panic, fear, and pressure can turn the tide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experienced units perform better — but have more to lose</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic World Map</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war is larger than a single battlefield.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select missions across a dynamic world map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure regions to gain resources and advantages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new areas and uncover hidden threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide where to strike next</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The signal is broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whatever attacked… isn’t done yet.</p>", "short_description": "A turn-based strategy where modern military forces face an unknown, unnatural enemy. Command elite units, manage morale, and survive in a world where the rules of war no longer apply.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700520/36e0691f63e5ffd25fcecea128cd6a5e74bfd997/header.jpg?t=1787907858", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700520/959fff6b06723ffd01d979fed6aca9c00cead743/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787907858", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4700520/959fff6b06723ffd01d979fed6aca9c00cead743/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787907858", "website": "https://www.nice-to-have.cz/en/days-of-reckoning/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Direc